<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Pls Donate Auto Typer</Major>
    <Description>This macro is for anyone looking for a reliable Pls Donate AFK typer. An AFK typer is a type of macro that types out messages for you in a game when you're not actually at the keyboard to type them out and is a great method many people use in games like Pls Donate. What makes this auto typer special is the fact that it cycles between different messages, making it harder for people to notice your macro usage.

Notes:
 - Make sure you have gamepasses or shirts avalible for purchase in game so people can actually donate to you. If you don't know how to make a gamepass or shirt, search up "Roblox gamepass tutorial for Pls Donate".
 - You don't need to press / to open the chat box or enter to send a message as this macro is fully automated to handle those things!
 - If you want me to add more things to this macro or have any suggestions for new messages it should cycle through, give the creator (me) a message.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
